sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Route as analyse route
    participant Parser as document-parser
    participant Pipe as pipeline
    participant AI as Gemini LLM
    participant VER as Crossref + OpenAlex
    Client->>Route: POST /api/v1/analyse (multipart)
    alt guard fails
        Route->>Client: 401 / 429 / 400 / 413
    end
    Route->>Parser: parseDocument
    Parser->>Parser: mammoth / unpdf / split
    Parser->>Route: bodyText, refText, paraMeta
    Route->>Pipe: runAnalysisPipeline
    par 3 parallel Gemini calls
        Pipe->>AI: extractCitations (chunked)
        Pipe->>AI: parseReferences (chunked)
        Pipe->>AI: detectUncitedClaims (fail-soft)
    end
    Pipe->>AI: matchCitationsToReferences
    Pipe->>AI: checkStyle (skip if no body)
    Pipe->>Pipe: build citation results
    loop per reference
        Pipe->>VER: Crossref validate
        alt unverified + DOI/title
            Pipe->>VER: OpenAlex fallback (merged)
        end
        Pipe->>VER: retraction check (reuses work)
    end
    Pipe->>Pipe: assemble + recency (counts only)
    Pipe->>Route: PipelineResult
    Route->>Client: 200 JSON (full payload)
